      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I understand the test well. I'll improve understandability by: removing unused data-provider methods that belong to the full test class, trimming unused imports, and extracting helper methods to name and isolate the CE vs BCE assertion logic.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version extracts the CE and BCE assertion logic into named helper methods (`assertCeYearProperties` / `assertBceYearProperties`), removes ~100 lines of unused data-provider methods inherited from the full test class, and trims imports to only what the test actually needs — making the intent of each loop immediately clear."
